version: 1.1.0
# Concept DOI: always resolves to the latest archived release on Zenodo.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23682463
date-released: 2026-08-12
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An extended OPV-DB release derived from the original OPV-DB by Qiu, J. and
  merged with an independently literature-mined organic photovoltaic
  device-record collection. Contains a consolidated single-junction device
  table with strict performance and strict molecular benchmark tier columns, a
  material-reference table, and validation summaries.
